        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A driveway and paving contractor with twenty years of work, a Facebook page and no website at all."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Every job came from word of mouth. Customers who heard the name could not find a website, a gallery or a way to request a quote without calling during the working day."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "A fast, photo-led website built in three weeks: services, gallery, areas, quote form",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Two hundred job photos sorted by material and area",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Google Business Profile with the same photos and a review routine",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Service area pages for Dublin and Kildare towns",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A small Google Ads campaign on 'driveway' and 'patio' searches from launch day",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "The site brought thirty-one quote requests in its first sixty days, and the contractor booked out the following season."
        }
      ]
    },
